@base = http://localhost:5160

### Health — topology, transactions, change streams
GET {{base}}/health

### Catalog search — $text search, ranked by text score
GET {{base}}/products?search=wireless

### Tag filter — array containment
GET {{base}}/products?tag=usb-c

### Schemaless spec filter — dot notation into Specs
GET {{base}}/products?specKey=color&specValue=black

### One spec value without loading the document
GET {{base}}/products/{{createProduct.response.body.id}}/specs/color

### Create a product
# @name createProduct
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "HD-777",
  "name": "Nimbus Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "Wireless mechanical keyboard with hot-swappable switches.",
  "category": "Accessories",
  "price": 149.99,
  "tags": ["wireless", "mechanical"],
  "specs": { "color": "black", "switches": "linear" },
  "stock": 25,
  "rating": 4.6
}

### Idempotent order — first call creates it (201)
# @name createOrder
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-2026-11-16-001

{
  "productId": "{{createProduct.response.body.id}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Same key again — returns the SAME order (200, no second charge)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-2026-11-16-001

{
  "productId": "{{createProduct.response.body.id}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Aggregation — revenue by category ($lookup + $group)
GET {{base}}/analytics/revenue-by-category

### Aggregation — top products by units sold
GET {{base}}/analytics/top-products?limit=5

### Aggregation — average rating by category
GET {{base}}/analytics/average-rating

### Driver vs EF Core provider — same query, timed
GET {{base}}/compare?category=Audio

### Recent change-stream events
GET {{base}}/changes
